o "How do I become a ticketholder?"
-----------------------------------

 - Simply call: 1.206.772.6922

 - We'll get you set up and experiencing the theatre, usually within a matter 
   of minutes.

o "Can I sign-up online?"
-------------------------

   We take the security and privacy needs of our customers very seriously. Due 
to the insecurities currently inherent to the Internet, we can not accept 
billing information over the net. In fact, we don't even keep this information 
on an Internet accessible machine, to ensure security.

   Signing up online would really be easier for us, so rest assured, we are 
currently looking at ways of doing this, but securely.   
